          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\">More precise cutting and control with less fatigue.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Stryker Precison cartridges only oscillate at the tip of the cartridge, greatly reducing excursion and vibration.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
