          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 01 2022 15:41:41 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Control</span></span></span></p>\n<p><b>Stationary cartridge design</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Allows for free-hand stabilization of&nbsp; the cartridge body</li>\n<li>Eliminates wear on the cut guide and 84% reduction in metal as shown in cadaveric TKA model</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Oscillating tip design</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>23% reduction in excursion arc versus a sgaital blade<sup>2</sup></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 01 2022 15:57:51 GMT+0000",
